<BaseLayout title="About"><section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16"><p class="eyebrow">About this place</p><h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold text-ink">Notes from the workbench.</h1><div class="prose mt-8"><p>I started Musings as somewhere to put the explanations I wanted when I was learning a system: the useful model, the assumptions underneath it, and the caveats that tend to get lost in the short version.</p><p>The subject is defensive security, but the habit is broader: follow a mechanism until it becomes clear where it helps, where it stops helping, and what a person has to do next.</p><p>These are personal working notes, not a source of final answers. I update them when I find a clearer way to explain something or notice an important gap.</p><p>This is a static site. There are no accounts, trackers, comments, or hidden application services.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
